    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190680/extras/e0f50abb714f5bed5f8c96a54fa254e6.avif?t=1675623061\" /></div><br><br>Something is happening in the neighborhood...<br>Help the Detective solve the mystery.<br><br>Play as The Detective and seek evidence and clues to solve the mystery of the Billy Case and find the guilty of this terrible crime.<br><br>-Talk with the neighbors to ask for information about what they saw.<br>-Avoid aggressive enemies <br>-Use Detective weapons to find who is behind this<br><br>Besides billy, There are other mysteries happening in the G building. The people are starting to get crazy and aggressive.",
